# Trivy ignore list — documented, time-bounded vulnerability exceptions.
#
# Trivy auto-discovers this file at the scan working directory (cloudbuild.yaml `trivy-scan` step).
# The image scan is BLOCKING (HIGH,CRITICAL, fixable). Add an entry here ONLY for an accepted risk that
# is tracked per the Vulnerability Management policy (docs/operations/VULN_MANAGEMENT.md §2/§5):
#   - one CVE/advisory ID per line,
#   - with a comment giving the owner + an expiry date,
#   - and a compensating control or "no upstream fix" justification.
#
# Format (uncomment + fill in to use):
#   # CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  owner:<name>  expires:YYYY-MM-DD  reason:<no upstream fix | compensating control>
#
# No active exceptions.
